cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "TelemDrift"
abstract: "Streaming change detection on a univariate telemetry channel scored at equal operating point — Page-Hinkley, CUSUM, EWMA, windowed Kolmogorov-Smirnov and an ADWIN-style adaptive window, each with a stated threshold-setting procedure, compared by ARL0 and detection delay with confidence intervals and by the delay-versus-false-alarm trade-off curve rather than at default thresholds, including every detector's behaviour on a transient spike that should not alarm; learned windowed-feature detector against the analytic detectors at equal ARL0."
type: software
